{"4299750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meet Mary", "steam_appid": 4299750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4884450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>1 PROLOGUE, 9 CHAPTERS, 19 UNIQUE LEVELS!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoyable for solo and group players.  Designed for people who love story, horror, comedy, escape rooms and looking for a game to enjoy with your friends. How far will you go to save a friend? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299750/extras/f90dc0d8eefa396d2e5f02516d94d2fb.avif?t=1785970911\" width=1178 height=692 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Horror:</strong> Scary situations and never knowing what comes next. Will you be safe on your journey? or are you headed to you inevitable doom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Compelling story that will keep you interested and finding yourself asking questions about what is yet to come and what you have already experienced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut-scenes:</strong>  Voice acted and fully animated cut-scenes focused on immersion and entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle:</strong> Use your brains to figure out and interact with puzzles and how to move forward into the unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedy:</strong> Comedy relief tailored towards releasing tension, a feeling of safety, and not knowing what will come next or if you are safe.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>1 PROLOGUE, 9 CHAPTERS, 19 UNIQUE LEVELS!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoyable for solo and group players.  Designed for people who love story, horror, comedy, escape rooms and looking for a game to enjoy with your friends. How far will you go to save a friend? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299750/extras/f90dc0d8eefa396d2e5f02516d94d2fb.avif?t=1785970911\" width=1178 height=692 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Horror:</strong> Scary situations and never knowing what comes next. Will you be safe on your journey? or are you headed to you inevitable doom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Compelling story that will keep you interested and finding yourself asking questions about what is yet to come and what you have already experienced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut-scenes:</strong>  Voice acted and fully animated cut-scenes focused on immersion and entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle:</strong> Use your brains to figure out and interact with puzzles and how to move forward into the unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedy:</strong> Comedy relief tailored towards releasing tension, a feeling of safety, and not knowing what will come next or if you are safe.</p>", "short_description": "Experience a thrilling and comedic 1-4 player co-op horror story puzzle game. Learn how to move forward while delving deeper and deeper into the unknown. With a compelling story and casual progression, this is the perfect way to spend some time with friends.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299750/9a3861d11715fa5617f08af125e2cebb6b7790f8/header_alt_ass